              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "కంగారుపడు (kaṅgārupaḍu) is built from kaṅgāru, \"fluster, panic\", and the native verb paḍu, \"to feel, to suffer\" (DEDR 3853). The origin of kaṅgāru itself is not settled."
